{"overview":"ساتو شاید زیباترین دختر مدرسه باشد، اما سرد و بی‌لبخند است. وقتی همکلاسی‌اش اوشیو او را در یک کافه می‌بیند، راز ساتو را کشف می‌کند: او در واقع خجالتی و دست‌وپا‌لنگ است. با اشتراک‌گذاری علاقه به عکاسی و دسرها، ساتو و اوشیو پیوند می‌خورند و عاشقانه‌ای شیرین بین دو فرد اجتماعی‌ناپذیر شکل می‌گیرد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Sato may be the most beautiful girl in school but she's also the coldest, never smiling at anyone. When her classmate Oshio spots her at a café, he learns Sato's secret: she's actually just shy and clumsy. As Sato and Oshio bond over their shared interests in photography and desserts, a sweet romance starts to blossom between two socially awkward people.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/83LnFQOLHJIH59Sh4ORJ5t958Pb.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"伊藤美来","role":"Koharu Satō (voice)","photo":"/q2y0SbBKNeVLf5obxixFmmiM4hQ.jpg","en":"Miku Ito"},{"name":"石橋陽彩","role":"Sōta Oshio (voice)","photo":"/xDfX7mWq67zoymw5V7vEu22pf5r.jpg","en":"Hiiro Ishibashi"},{"name":"富田美憂","role":"Rinka Sudō (voice)","photo":"/rSR17l4HdchLkhpRuAZbGbXNmUS.jpg","en":"Miyu Tomita"},{"name":"小林千晃","role":"Ren Misono (voice)","photo":"/o0XZFXc50z28ICUpvfZ1QcTL2Yt.jpg","en":"Chiaki Kobayashi"},{"name":"青山吉能","role":"Shizuku Misono (voice)","photo":"/yPOprcT7tPKR3p79RMYtogTEXGr.jpg","en":"Yoshino Aoyama"},{"name":"金元寿子","role":"Mayo Nezu (voice)","photo":"/yosLId8iiPcvDZpeoLuGkDKlorU.jpg","en":"Hisako Kanemoto"},{"name":"یاسونوری ماتسوموتو","role":"Seizaemon Oshio (voice)","photo":"/12vPpqoppN12i3Zk313dwQsUQYi.jpg","en":"Yasunori Matsumoto"},{"name":"若井友希","role":"Madoka Murasaki (voice)","photo":"/29AGgDOC08B5Y0qKsb4Ij4P6uGT.jpg","en":"Yuki Wakai"}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/316891/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll